# Every route is rendered by the single-page app, so a deep link — a shared
# search, a word page — has to reach index.html rather than a 404. Status 200
# rather than 302 so the URL the visitor typed is the URL they keep.
#
# Listed after nothing: Pages evaluates _redirects top to bottom and stops at
# the first match, so this catch-all must stay last if others are ever added.
/*  /index.html  200
